# Pulled corpora — regenerate via jurisdiction connectors; not committed
# (public record, but kept out of git for size/provenance hygiene). Hand-crafted
# fixtures (evalsets/fixture, evalsets/us/mini) ARE committed.
#
# Deny by default rather than naming each slice: the rule used to list
# clerc-dev alone, and every connector run since has dropped another
# multi-megabyte directory here that a `git add -A` would have swept in.
evalsets/us/*
!evalsets/us/mini/

